# RivalVeil Server Configuration Example
# =======================================
# 1. Copy this file to .env:
#    Windows: copy .env.example .env
#    Linux:   cp .env.example .env
#
# 2. Fill in your actual values in .env
#
# 3. NEVER commit .env to version control!
#    Add .env to your .gitignore

# Database Configuration
# ----------------------
DB_HOST=localhost
DB_USER=root
DB_PASSWORD=your_database_password_here
DB_NAME=rivalveil
DB_PORT=3306

# Security Secrets
# ----------------
# FASTAPI_SECRET   — токен для будущей защиты клиентских эндпоинтов
# SERVER_API_SECRET — токен для /admin/cleanup (вызов во время демо если матч завис)
#
# Для локального теста можно оставить дефолты — сервер запустится, но покажет WARNING.
# Для публичного деплоя замени на любые случайные строки (минимум 16 символов).
#
# Пример вызова /admin/cleanup:
#   curl -X POST https://your-tunnel.trycloudflare.com/admin/cleanup \
#        -H "X-Server-Secret: your_server_secret_here"
FASTAPI_SECRET=change-me
SERVER_API_SECRET=server-secret

# GitHub Gist Token (for url_updater.py)
# --------------------------------------
# Create a personal access token at:
# https://github.com/settings/tokens
#
# Required scope: gist (to update your Gist)
#
# SECURITY WARNING: Keep this token secret!
# If exposed, revoke it immediately at GitHub.
GIST_TOKEN=ghp_your_github_token_here

# Game Server Configuration
# -------------------------
# Full path to your RivalVeil dedicated server executable
GAME_EXE_PATH=C:\RivalVeilServer\GameServer\RivalVeil.exe

# Directory for dedicated server logs
SERVER_LOG_DIR=C:\RivalVeilServer\logs

# FastAPI URL (for game server callbacks)
# This is updated automatically by url_updater.py
FASTAPI_URL=http://localhost:8000

# ===========================================
# HOW TO SETUP GITHUB GIST FOR DYNAMIC URL
# ===========================================
#
# 1. Create a new Gist at https://gist.github.com
#    - Filename: rivalveil_url.txt
#    - Content: http://localhost:8000 (temporary)
#    - Make it public or secret (doesn't matter for raw URL)
#
# 2. Get your Gist ID from the URL:
#    https://gist.github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/GIST_ID
#
# 3. Update GIST_ID in url_updater.py
#
# 4. Update GITHUB_USERNAME in url_updater.py
#
# 5. Update gistRawUrl in BackendService.cs (Unity)
#
# 6. The flow:
#    - url_updater.py writes Cloudflare URL to Gist
#    - Unity client reads URL from Gist raw URL
#    - Client connects to your server!
